  10:include/asm/swab.h ****  * When in big endian mode, byte accesses appear as:
  11:include/asm/swab.h ****  *  0 = d24...d31, 1 = d16...d23, 2 = d8...d15, 3 = d0...d7
  12:include/asm/swab.h ****  * and word accesses (data or instruction) appear as:
